'''''Crocus carpetanus'''''  is a species of [[flowering plant]] in the [[Iridaceae]] family.<ref name=WFoL>{{cite web|url= http://www.worldfloraonline.org/taxon/wfo-0000788595|title= Crocus carpetanus Boiss. & Reut.|author=<!--Not stated-->|date=n.d.|website=World Flora Online|publisher=The World Flora Online Consortium|access-date= September 18, 2020}}</ref> It is native to [[Portugal]] and [[Spain]].<ref name=KewPOWO>{{cite web|url= https://powo.science.kew.org/taxon/urn:lsid:ipni.org:names:436499-1|title= Crocus carpetanus Boiss. & Reut.|author=<!--Not stated-->|date=n.d.|website=Plants of the World Online|publisher=The Trustees of the Royal Botanic Gardens, Kew|access-date= September 18, 2020}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.tropicos.org/Name/100173721|title= Crocus carpetanus in Tropicos}}</ref>

